3. Documentation and data
-------------------------

Project documentation (`CLAUDE.md`, `EDITORIAL.md`, `_guidelines.md`, `README.md`,
`docs/`) and the source and claims ledger in `data/` are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0,
like the content in `src/`.

Exception: short quoted excerpts from third-party sources recorded in `data/`
(the `quote` fields) remain the property of their respective rights holders. They
are included only to make each claim verifiable against its source, are not
